T-1 ; return any active tool ; implies we are already homed
G94 ; mm/min feed  
M98 P"0:/macros/meshLevel.g" ; run meshLevel macro
T2 ; pick up tool one, baby bullet with nonplanar nozzle
M568 S220 ; heat current tool to 205 C (PLA)
M116 ; wait for temp
M83 ; relative extrusion 
G1 E30 ; prime extruder 
G94 ; mm/min feed 
G90 ; absolute positioning 
G0 C0 X0 Y0 Z20 B0 ; go to start (also set Y = 0 since after this not using)
G93 ; inverse time feed 
